description "Sith Seeker

Multi-life Dark Jedi pawns who attempt to ambush unsuspecting opponents with their cloak and inferior saber and force abilities.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Lightsaber (Staff/Duals/Cyan)
-- Saber Defense (1)
-- 135% Spec Dmg mult

^5Force Powers:
- Jump (2)
- Sense (1) 
- Drain (2)

^8Attributes:
- Dexterity (3)
- Force Block (1)
- Force Focus (2)
- Tracking Beacon

^8Abilities:
- Force Dampeners (Tracking Darts 3) ^3[CS1]
-- Causes Force Focus/Cripple On HIt
- Cloaking Device (2) ^3[CS2]
- Binoculars ^3[CS4]
- Dex Roll ^3[CS3]"
